      "body": "Bumps the ROCm 10.0 (TheRock) image to torch 2.14 / torchvision 0.29 (`+rocm10.0.0`), matching CUDA/CPU/XPU; torchaudio stays 2.11.0. Also refreshes the stale torch pins in the ROCm install docs.\n\nTheRock's torch 2.14 pins `triton==3.8.0+git669b31ac.rocm10.0.0`, the same commit we build from source, so the existing triton build/repack is unchanged.\n\nWill rebase on #62536 (ROCm 10.1) if it lands first. No other open PR bumps ROCm torch.\n\n**Test**\n- `pip install --dry-run` (stable index) of torch/torchvision 2.14/0.29 + device extras + torchaudio 2.11.0: resolves\n- `therock_wheels.py external-links` with the new pins + real torch wheel: all linked projects (9 arches) found\n- Image build + GPU tests: pending CI\n\nAI assistance (Claude Code) was used; I reviewed every change.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
